      <div id="p-0045" num="0044" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 22</figref> is side by side Scanning Electron Micrograph (SEM) images of cross sectional views showing asymmetrical calendering of Comparative Example 5 after calendering on a magnification of 6,000×. The top polyethylene layer was reduced to 1.72 μm and the bottom layer to 2.19 μm.</div>
      <div id="p-0046" num="0045" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 23</figref> shows respective surface roughness diagrams of respective stretched trilayer films at −10% TD and 200% TD stretch respectively.</div>
      <div id="p-0047" num="0046" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 24</figref> shows 3-D quantification diagrams of surface roughness of TD stretched trilayer film (A) vs TD stretched trilayer film (B).</div>
      <div id="p-0048" num="0047" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 25</figref> is a graph depicting the pin removal performance after the incorporation of lithium stearate.</div>
